wers to read and stick to the DW netiquette policy on our channel: https://p.dw.com/p/MF1G","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/XtBuPjp-Zm4/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Documentaries","city":"","country":"","channel":"DW Documentary","channelTitle":"DW Documentary","channelId":"UCW39zufHfsuGgpLviKh297Q","badge":"DOCUMENTARY","publishedAt":"2026-07-29T16:00:23Z","viewCount":39012,"durationSeconds":3146,"admission":{"version":3,"status":"channel-candidate","source":"channel-archive","mode":"DOCUMENTARIES"}}',1);
