DW Documental on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/dwdocumental We kindly ask viewers to read and stick to the DW netiquette policy on our channel: https://p.dw.com/p/MF1G","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QnQ6o2pSQS8/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Documentaries","city":"","country":"","channel":"DW Documentary","channelTitle":"DW Documentary","channelId":"UCW39zufHfsuGgpLviKh297Q","badge":"DOCUMENTARY","publishedAt":"2017-01-13T11:49:18Z","viewCount":34986,"durationSeconds":2556,"admission":{"version":3,"status":"channel-candidate","source":"channel-archive","mode":"DOCUMENTARIES"}}',1);
